{"task":"transcribe","language":"en","duration":50.644125,"text":"These are the three AI agents I would hire if I was scaling a coaching business to 50k. As you grow your following, your agent should be able to score them against your ideal client profile, begin qualifying them with something like many chats, scheduling calls with them, or just getting them to buy. It studies what your buyers are actually saying, then builds the content that pulls in more people just like your best clients. How many clients you can handle, how much money you're making a month, is directly related to all the prep work that goes in. Before every coaching call, you should be getting a brief that goes through everything that your client is working on, what their status is, and what their goals are. This would also run all your reminders and scheduling for that optimal client experience. And of course, the glue that makes all these agents actually work is a shared knowledge base. Everything you can record, everything that's stuck in your head, needs to be put in an actual file. That's a whole team for the price of a subscription.","words":null,"segments":[{"avg_logprob":-0.10904137221341198,"compression_ratio":1.7402985074626867,"end":2.04,"id":1,"no_speech_prob":0.020725518465042114,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"temperature":0.0,"text":" These are the three AI agents I would hire","tokens":[50364,1981,366,264,1045,7318,12554,286,576,11158,50466],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.10904137221341198,"compression_ratio":1.7402985074626867,"end":4.44,"id":2,"no_speech_prob":0.020725518465042114,"seek":0,"start":2.04,"temperature":0.0,"text":" if I was scaling a coaching business to 50k.","tokens":[50466,498,286,390,21589,257,15818,1606,281,2625,74,13,50586],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.10904137221341198,"compression_ratio":1.7402985074626867,"end":5.52,"id":3,"no_speech_prob":0.020725518465042114,"seek":0,"start":4.44,"temperature":0.0,"text":" As you grow your following,","tokens":[50586,1018,291,